# .NET build output of the Roslyn solutions (Aspid.MVVM.Generators, Aspid.MVVM.Analyzers, Aspid.MVVM.Unity.Generators)
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
[Tt]est[Rr]esults/
*.binlog
